# Allow-list: send only what the images need to the Docker build context.
# Keeps the context small (no dataset, venv, mlruns) and secrets (.env) out of every image.
*
!requirements-serve.txt
!requirements-api.txt
!requirements-api-lite.txt
!src/visionguard/*.py
!app/
!api/
!wsgi.py
!models/champion.keras
!models/champion.json
!deploy/render/champion.tflite
!deploy/render/champion.json
**/__pycache__
